Global
  ctrl+c  Quit gofer
  ctrl+y  Toggle guardrails for new sessions (same as /yolo)
  ctrl+r  Toggle reply-on-run for shell commands (reply now / queue)
Roster
  ↑/↓        Move the roster selection
  enter      Open the selected session, or run what's typed
  →          Open the selected session (empty dispatch bar)
  space      Peek the selected session (empty dispatch bar)
  tab        Switch flat / grouped roster view
  esc        Clear the dispatch bar
